],"names":null},"ops":[["nt",""],["sk",""],["wt","s"],["ha","y"],["cb","0200"],["cg","010"],["cr","0200"],["hc","ct"],["at","\nWest leads the @C10 against your contract of Four Spades."],["pg",""],["lc","ct"],["pc","ct"],["hc","sq"],["nt","\nYou can afford three losers. You are missing the @SQ "],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["hs","sh"],["at","and you have a Heart loser "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","sd"],["at","and a Diamond loser. "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["hc","sq"],["at","It looks as though you will make your contract even if you lose a trick to the @SQ."],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["hs","ss"],["hs","ns"],["nt","\nThe danger here is that you can afford one loser in the trump suit, but you cannot afford two losers. "],["pg",""],["ls","ss"],["ls","ns"],["hc","sq"],["at","If you try to take a finesse and it happens to lose to the @SQ, "],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["hs","ws"],["at","the opponents will still have a trump left. They may be able to use it to trump "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["hs","nc"],["at","one of your winners, producing an unexpected loser."],["pg",""],["nt","\nIn the above layout, if you win the first trick "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","ns"],["at","and play a Spade "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["hc","sa"],["at","to the @SA, "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sj"],["at","followed by the @SJ "],["pg",""],["lc","sj"],["pc","sj"],["pc","s"],["hs","ns"],["at","for a finesse (because you have eight cards in the combined hands) the contract suddenly strikes a reef! "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["pc","s"],["hc","sq"],["at","East can win the @SQ "],["pg",""],["lc","sq"],["pc","sq"],["pg",""],["hs","ec"],["at","and lead another Club "],["pg",""],["ls","ec"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["hs","ws"],["at","and West can trump with his remaining small Spade. "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["pc","s"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["hs","sh"],["at","You still have to lose the Heart "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","sd"],["at","and the Diamond tricks."],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["up","12"],["md","0,sq,,s7"],["hc","sa"],["nt","\nThe safe play is to take the @SA "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sk"],["at","and the @SK. "],["pg",""],["lc","sk"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","sk"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","sq"],["at","If the @SQ doesn't appear, you can afford to lose a trick to it. That will be the only Spade loser."],["",""]]}}